-- The keep: level three, which is a boss fight. There is no `exit` tile in
-- this legend on purpose — the way out of this level is the fight, and a tile
-- that ended it would be a door round the back of the warden.
--
-- `lava` is not solid, so it is fallen into rather than stopped at. That is the
-- same arrangement `spikes` has, and it is what makes a causeway a causeway.

tile #  wall     solid  quest.keepwall.svg
tile o  post     solid  quest.stoneblock.svg
tile _  bedrock  solid  quest.keepstone.svg
tile =  ledge    solid  quest.keepfloor.svg
tile ~  lava            quest.lava.svg
tile .  air             quest.gloom.svg

map
